    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Monkey Testing \u2013 Ethics or Power? The Choice is Yours!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the <strong>head security officer</strong> of a secret research facility, oversee <strong>super soldier projects</strong> and <strong>disease treatments</strong> through cutting-edge experiments. Conduct <strong>genetic, chemical, and psychological tests</strong> on monkeys to shape the future of humanity. But remember, <strong>every experiment comes at a cost.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this massive laboratory, you must choose between <strong>ethical principles and corporate interests</strong>. Will you remain a loyal part of a powerful system, or will you expose the hidden truths lurking in the shadows?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462340/extras/cee2125422eead71aab9d6c0b73009b0.poster.avif?t=1754494939\" width=800 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462340/extras/cee2125422eead71aab9d6c0b73009b0.webm?t=1754494939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462340/extras/cee2125422eead71aab9d6c0b73009b0.mp4?t=1754494939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd2c\u00a0<strong>Key Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SCIENTIFIC EXPERIMENTS &amp; BEHAVIORAL TESTING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform <strong>chemical injections, psychological trials, and behavioral experiments</strong> as part of the super soldier program. Each test alters the intelligence, strength, and aggression levels of the monkeys.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BALANCING SECURITY AND CHAOS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prevent the experiments from spiraling out of control. <strong>Manage your guards, stop escape attempts, and suppress riots.</strong> But be careful\u2014too much pressure may lead to an explosive outcome.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ETHICS OR LOYALTY? THE CHOICE IS YOURS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you follow <strong>corporate orders to complete the experiments</strong>, or will you <strong>reveal the dark secrets of the laboratory</strong>? Your choices will shape the story\u2019s direction.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MONKEY EXPERIMENTS &amp; EVOLUTION MECHANICS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monkeys can become <strong>highly intelligent, aggressive, or depressed</strong>. Maintain a delicate balance\u2014<strong>smart monkeys may plan escapes, while aggressive ones may incite riots.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462340/extras/e6dba64c6e98bd26634a8eead8c62c9d.poster.avif?t=1754494939\" width=798 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462340/extras/e6dba64c6e98bd26634a8eead8c62c9d.webm?t=1754494939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462340/extras/e6dba64c6e98bd26634a8eead8c62c9d.mp4?t=1754494939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHAOS &amp; REBELLION SCENARIOS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If things go wrong, <strong>monkeys may riot, guards may abandon their posts, and the facility could plunge into total chaos.</strong> Maintain order or watch everything collapse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay Mechanics</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment Management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guard Supervision</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaos and Riot Control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ethical Decision-Making</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evidence Concealment &amp; Whistleblowing</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ADD TO YOUR WISHLIST NOW!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maintain order, protect the system, or spark a revolution.</strong><br><strong>The line between science, ethics, and control is razor-thin\u2026 Which side will you choose?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add to Your Wishlist Now and Be Among the First to Play!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Monkey Testing \u2013 Ethics or Power? The Choice is Yours!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the <strong>head security officer</strong> of a secret research facility, oversee <strong>super soldier projects</strong> and <strong>disease treatments</strong> through cutting-edge experiments. Conduct <strong>genetic, chemical, and psychological tests</strong> on monkeys to shape the future of humanity. But remember, <strong>every experiment comes at a cost.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this massive laboratory, you must choose between <strong>ethical principles and corporate interests</strong>. Will you remain a loyal part of a powerful system, or will you expose the hidden truths lurking in the shadows?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462340/extras/cee2125422eead71aab9d6c0b73009b0.poster.avif?t=1754494939\" width=800 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462340/extras/cee2125422eead71aab9d6c0b73009b0.webm?t=1754494939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462340/extras/cee2125422eead71aab9d6c0b73009b0.mp4?t=1754494939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd2c\u00a0<strong>Key Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SCIENTIFIC EXPERIMENTS &amp; BEHAVIORAL TESTING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform <strong>chemical injections, psychological trials, and behavioral experiments</strong> as part of the super soldier program. Each test alters the intelligence, strength, and aggression levels of the monkeys.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BALANCING SECURITY AND CHAOS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prevent the experiments from spiraling out of control. <strong>Manage your guards, stop escape attempts, and suppress riots.</strong> But be careful\u2014too much pressure may lead to an explosive outcome.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ETHICS OR LOYALTY? THE CHOICE IS YOURS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you follow <strong>corporate orders to complete the experiments</strong>, or will you <strong>reveal the dark secrets of the laboratory</strong>? Your choices will shape the story\u2019s direction.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MONKEY EXPERIMENTS &amp; EVOLUTION MECHANICS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monkeys can become <strong>highly intelligent, aggressive, or depressed</strong>. Maintain a delicate balance\u2014<strong>smart monkeys may plan escapes, while aggressive ones may incite riots.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462340/extras/e6dba64c6e98bd26634a8eead8c62c9d.poster.avif?t=1754494939\" width=798 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462340/extras/e6dba64c6e98bd26634a8eead8c62c9d.webm?t=1754494939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462340/extras/e6dba64c6e98bd26634a8eead8c62c9d.mp4?t=1754494939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHAOS &amp; REBELLION SCENARIOS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If things go wrong, <strong>monkeys may riot, guards may abandon their posts, and the facility could plunge into total chaos.</strong> Maintain order or watch everything collapse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay Mechanics</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment Management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guard Supervision</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaos and Riot Control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ethical Decision-Making</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evidence Concealment &amp; Whistleblowing</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ADD TO YOUR WISHLIST NOW!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maintain order, protect the system, or spark a revolution.</strong><br><strong>The line between science, ethics, and control is razor-thin\u2026 Which side will you choose?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add to Your Wishlist Now and Be Among the First to Play!</strong></p>",
